        <mxCell id="t192" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f5f5f5;font-weight:bold;text-align:center&quot;&gt;ENUM NotifChannel&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;web, mobile, email (array)&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2472" y="1650" width="330" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t193" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f5f5f5;font-weight:bold;text-align:center&quot;&gt;ENUM SubjectCategory&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;CORE, ELECTIVE&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2472" y="1710" width="330" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t194" value="&lt;div style=&quot;background:#f5f5f5;font-weight:bold;text-align:center&quot;&gt;ENUM TimetableStatus&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;DRAFT, SUBMITTED, APPROVED&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#888888;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="2472" y="1770" width="330" height="52" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t195" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-size:20px;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;ZENTRA — Full Technical ERD (45 entities, PostgreSQL / Prisma)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;Source: backend/prisma/schema.prisma + migrations. PK = primary key, FK = foreign key (&amp;#8594;parent), UK = unique, PF/UF = PK/UK that is also an FK, ? = nullable, xor = SQL CHECK exactly-one-of. Crow-foot (&amp;#9495;) = MANY side, bar = ONE side. Grey AttendanceRecordLegacy = read-only archive, no relations.&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="16" width="2782" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="t196" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight:bold&quot;&gt;LEGEND &amp;amp; CONFLICT FOOTNOTES (verified read-only)&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;1) StudentRoster has NO CREATE TABLE in any migration SQL (roster FKs reference it anyway) — included from Prisma as app truth; needs a migration. 2) AttendanceRecordLegacy: frozen archive, zero FKs. 3) AdviserArchivedStudent.studentId/rosterId are plain strings (no FK, no CHECK) — shown without connectors. 4) recordedBy on AttendanceRecord / createdBy on SchoolYear.createdBy, Assessment.createdBy are plain strings (no FK). 5) Legacy AM/PM dedup lives in partial unique indexes (SQL-only, WHERE subjectId IS NULL). 6) onDelete: CASCADE default; SET NULL: AnecdotalRecord.folderId, AttendanceRecord.assignmentId, Timetable submitter/reviewer, TeacherName.userId, TeacherTermGrant.teacherNameId; RESTRICT: AttendanceRecord.subjectId, CounselingSession.createdBy, ClinicAttachment.uploadedBy.&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#999999;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="30" y="1850" width="2782" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
